ct a theme","role":"project","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"15min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything."}],"kind":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","kind":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further","title":"Going further with more resources","type":"topic","role":"project","estimatedTime":"10min","abstract":[{"text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"kind":"project","role":"project","type":"topic","estimatedTime":"30min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","title":"Add more OUDS components"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things","kind":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-thing